   226→        description: |-
   227→          Optional verbose output for shadow branch operations.
   228→
   229→          By default, auto-commit failures are silent (see @shadow-autocommit ac-6).
   230→          Debug mode surfaces these errors for troubleshooting.
   231→
   232→          Enable via:
   233→          - KSPEC_DEBUG=1 environment variable
   234→          - --verbose flag on any command
   235→
   236→          When enabled:
   237→          - Auto-commit failures are reported to stderr
   238→          - Git operations show underlying commands
   239→          - Useful for diagnosing worktree/branch issues
   240→        acceptance_criteria:
