   242→            given: KSPEC_DEBUG=1 is set and auto-commit fails
   243→            when: any state-changing command runs
   244→            then: error message is printed to stderr
   245→          - id: ac-2
   246→            given: '--verbose flag is passed and auto-commit fails'
   247→            when: any state-changing command runs
   248→            then: error message is printed to stderr
   249→          - id: ac-3
   250→            given: debug mode is not enabled
   251→            when: auto-commit fails
   252→            then: no error output is shown (silent failure)
