   331→        acceptance_criteria:
   332→          - id: ac-1
   333→            given: git remote origin exists and origin/kspec-meta branch exists
   334→            when: user runs kspec init
   335→            then: creates worktree from remote branch with tracking configured
   336→          - id: ac-2
   337→            given: git remote origin exists but origin/kspec-meta does not exist
   338→            when: user runs kspec init
   339→            then: creates orphan branch locally, pushes to remote to establish tracking
   340→          - id: ac-3
   341→            given: no git remote configured
   342→            when: user runs kspec init
   343→            then: creates orphan branch locally without remote tracking (current behavior)
   344→          - id: ac-4
   345→            given: origin remote exists
   346→            when: checking for remote shadow branch
   347→            then: runs git fetch origin to ensure remote refs are up to date
