   480→        description: |
   481→          kspec shadow repair
   482→
   483→          Re-establishes worktree if .kspec/ is deleted or corrupted:
   484→          - Recreates worktree link from .git/worktrees/.kspec
   485→          - Detects and reports common corruption scenarios
   486→          - Handles: stale locks, orphaned worktrees, detached HEAD
   487→
   488→          Acceptance criteria:
   489→          - Recovers from deleted .kspec/ directory
   490→          - Reports clear error if shadow branch itself is missing
   491→          - Idempotent (safe to run multiple times)
   492→        implements:
