   515→    title: Shadow Remote Sync
   516→    type: feature
   517→    tags: []
   518→    description: >-
   519→      Automatic synchronization of shadow branch with remote repository. After each local
   520→      auto-commit, attempt push to remote. On session start or read operations, pull remote changes
   521→      first.
   522→    depends_on: []
   523→    implements: []
   524→    relates_to: []
   525→    tests: []
