   527→    acceptance_criteria:
   528→      - id: ac-1
   529→        given: remote tracking is configured for shadow branch
   530→        when: a state-changing operation commits to shadow branch
   531→        then: kspec attempts to push to remote (fire-and-forget, errors ignored)
   532→      - id: ac-2
   533→        given: remote tracking is configured
   534→        when: session start runs
   535→        then: kspec pulls remote changes before showing session context
   536→      - id: ac-3
   537→        given: pull encounters a conflict
   538→        when: sync is attempted
   539→        then: local operation succeeds, warning displayed, user directed to run kspec shadow resolve
   540→      - id: ac-4
   541→        given: no remote tracking configured
   542→        when: sync would normally occur
   543→        then: sync is silently skipped (no error)
   544→      - id: ac-5
   545→        given: shadow branch has unresolved sync conflict
   546→        when: user runs kspec shadow resolve
   547→        then: interactive conflict resolution guides user through resolving conflicts
   548→      - id: ac-6
   549→        given: sync uses git pull
   550→        when: pulling remote changes
   551→        then: uses --ff-only first, falls back to --rebase if needed
   552→      - id: ac-7
   553→        given: new shadow branch is created and origin remote exists
   554→        when: initializeShadow completes
   555→        then: tracking is configured to origin/kspec-meta regardless of push success
   556→      - id: ac-8
   557→        given: shadow branch exists without tracking and main branch has origin remote
   558→        when: any sync operation is attempted
   559→        then: tracking is automatically configured to origin/kspec-meta
